<v Ira Glass>WBEZ管理层对我们节目的监督由托里·马拉蒂亚先生负责，我会这样描述他。

00:58:15.260 --> 00:58:20.610
<v Gillian Aldrich>He enjoys sing-alongs with his guitar, talks freely about sex, makes a living as a computer programmer.
<v Gillian Aldrich>他喜欢弹着吉他唱歌，谈性很开放，靠做电脑程序员谋生。

00:58:20.610 --> 00:58:55.600
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯，下周带着《美国生活》的更多故事回归。

00:58:55.600 --> 00:59:00.600
